### Todo API Collection — VS Code REST Client
### Story coverage: US-001..US-006
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/todos

### Story: US-006, AC: 1 — List all todos
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### Story: US-001, AC: 1 — Create a valid todo
# @name createTodo
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Buy groceries"
}

### Story: US-001, AC: 2 — Create a todo with empty text -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": ""
}

### Story: US-001, AC: 2 — Create a todo with whitespace-only text -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "   "
}

### Story: US-002, AC: 1 — Toggle a todo's completed state
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{createTodo.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### Story: US-002, AC: 2 — Update a non-existent todo -> 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### Story: US-001, AC: 3 — Update a todo to empty text -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{createTodo.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "   "
}

### Story: US-003, AC: 1 — Delete a todo -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{createTodo.response.body.id}}

### Story: US-003, AC: 2 — Delete a non-existent todo -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist

### Story: US-005, AC: 1 — Clear completed todos
POST {{baseUrl}}/clear-completed
